{
  "info": {
    "name": "Finance Tracker API",
    "description": "Personal Finance Tracker — backend API.\n\nDan 14: Auth (register/login/me) + Users CRUD (RBAC + ownership + soft delete).\n\n## Kako koristiti\n1. Podesi `baseUrl` varijablu (default: http://localhost:3000)\n2. Pozovi **Auth > Login (Ana - admin)** ili **Login (Marko - user)** — token se AUTOMATSKI upisuje u `token` varijablu (vidi Scripts tab).\n3. Svi zaštićeni zahtevi koriste `{{token}}` iz Authorization header-a.\n4. Za testiranje RBAC/ownership: uloguj se kao Marko pa probaj admin-only rute — očekuj 403.\n\n## Seed nalozi\n- ana@test.com / password123 (admin)\n- marko@test.com / password123 (user)",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:3000",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Health",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET /health",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/health",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["health"]
            },
            "description": "Dokazuje da ceo middleware chain radi. Bez auth-a."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST /auth/register",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "// Auto-upis tokena posle uspesne registracije",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "    const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    if (json.token) {",
                  "        pm.collectionVariables.set('token', json.token);",
                  "        console.log('Token upisan (register):', json.token.slice(0, 20) + '...');",
                  "    }",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Test User\",\n  \"email\": \"test@test.com\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/register",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "register"]
            },
            "description": "Javan endpoint. `role` se IGNORISE cak i ako se posalje (anti privilege-escalation) — novi user je uvek 'user'. Vraca { user, token } (201)."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /auth/login (Ana - admin)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "// Auto-upis tokena posle uspesnog login-a",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    if (json.token) {",
                  "        pm.collectionVariables.set('token', json.token);",
                  "        console.log('Token upisan (Ana):', json.token.slice(0, 20) + '...');",
                  "    }",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"ana@test.com\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "login"]
            },
            "description": "Login kao admin. Token se automatski upisuje u {{token}} varijablu."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /auth/login (Marko - user)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    if (json.token) {",
                  "        pm.collectionVariables.set('token', json.token);",
                  "        console.log('Token upisan (Marko):', json.token.slice(0, 20) + '...');",
                  "    }",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"marko@test.com\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "login"]
            },
            "description": "Login kao obican user. Koristi za testiranje RBAC/ownership (admin-only rute treba da vrate 403)."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /auth/me",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/me",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "me"]
            },
            "description": "Vraca { id, email, role } iz verifikovanog JWT-a. Ne dira `users` niz."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Users",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET /users (admin only)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/users",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["users"]
            },
            "description": "Lista svih user-a. SAMO admin (requireRole). Obican user → 403. Bez tokena → 401. Nikad ne vraca password_hash."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /users/:id (admin ili sam)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/users/2",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["users", "2"]
            },
            "description": "Ownership pattern: admin vidi bilo koga, user vidi samo sebe. Marko → /users/1 (Ana) treba 403."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "PATCH /users/:id (name — dozvoljeno)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Novo Ime\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/users/2",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["users", "2"]
            },
            "description": "Ownership + parcijalni update. User sme svoj name/email."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "PATCH /users/:id (role — samo admin)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"role\": \"admin\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/users/2",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["users", "2"]
            },
            "description": "role/isActive sme SAMO admin (Pattern 1). Obican user koji posalje role → 403 'You cannot change role or account status'. Admin → 200."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "DELETE /users/:id (soft delete, admin only)",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/users/2",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["users", "2"]
            },
            "description": "Soft delete — postavlja isActive:false, ne brise iz niza. Samo admin. Vraca 204 No Content. Posle ovoga Markov login → 403 'Account is deactivated'."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}